    h1: "College Football Playoff Picks 2026 - Free CFP Predictions",
    body: "\n<p>The College Football Playoff is the biggest betting event on the college calendar, and this page delivers free expert CFP picks and predictions all the way to the national championship. The expanded 12-team format has transformed the postseason, adding first-round campus games, more matchups, and more betting opportunities than ever before. Our analysts break down every playoff game with a spread pick, a total lean, and championship futures value. Pair this with our <a href=\"/picks/college-football-picks/\">college football picks</a> and <a href=\"/picks/college-football-best-bets-today/\">CFB best bets</a>.</p>\n<h2>Betting the Expanded 12-Team Playoff</h2>\n<p>The expanded playoff created an entirely new betting landscape. First-round games are played on campus, giving higher seeds a genuine home-field edge that the market is still learning to price. The additional rounds mean teams face layoffs, travel, and physical tolls that factor heavily into handicapping. Byes for top seeds, rematch dynamics, and the motivation gap between a team thrilled just to make the field and one with title expectations all create value across the bracket.</p>\n<h2>How We Handicap Playoff Games</h2>\n<p>Our CFP analysis weighs the campus home-field edge in first-round games, rest and layoff differentials between rounds, style matchups that decide elite games, and how each team's strengths translate against a specific opponent. We also track championship futures, looking for teams whose title odds offer value relative to their path through the bracket. Playoff football rewards trench dominance and quarterback play, and we lean into those fundamentals.</p>\n<h2>National Championship Futures</h2>\n<p>Beyond individual games, the playoff offers championship futures value throughout the bracket. A team with a favorable path or an underpriced title number can offer strong value even after the field is set. For season-long context, see our <a href=\"/picks/college-football-predictions-today/\">college football predictions</a>, and for parlay action across the bracket check our <a href=\"/picks/college-football-parlay-picks/\">CFB parlay picks</a>.</p>\n<h2>Get Your Free CFP Picks</h2>\n<p>Bookmark this page for free College Football Playoff picks throughout the postseason, including spreads, totals, and championship futures. Always bet responsibly and within your bankroll.</p>\n",
